=
\frac{1+\dfrac{s}{\omega_0}}
{\dfrac{s}{\omega_0}}\] \[\boxed{\text{(A) }\frac{1+\dfrac{s}{\omega_0}}
{\dfrac{s}{\omega_0}}}\]

